base_view: polar_equipment_large_public__equipmenttype
label: Equipment Types
description: Equipment-type records with public safety-index field context.
fields:
- polar_equipment_large_public__equipmenttype.*
joins: {}
ai_context: 'This topic models no cross-table joins.

  Domain definitions for this topic:

  - Overall Safety Performance Index (OSPI): OSPI = \text{safety index}/100 \times EER \times 0.8

  - Sustainable Polar Operations (SPO): Polar operations are defined as ''sustainable'' when the site maintains RSSI > 0.7 and EWRII > 0.65, with waste management status = ''Normal'' and environmental impact index < 6.0.'
